  "summary": "Malicious code in test1ro (npm)",
  "details": "The package is a 438-byte stub with no real functionality. Its preinstall and postinstall hooks both run index.js, which reads the machine hostname and sends it over HTTP to the endpoint eo8f3m3ho26a0nm[.]m[.]pipedream[.]net under the path /test1ro?h=\u003chostname\u003e. Installing the package therefore phones home with the host's identity on every install.",
